Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 06:13:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RFI: attach photos & videos (phone camera/gallery upload)

- New lib/rfi/upload.ts: resumable Storage upload to projects/{id}/rfis/...
  (already permitted by storage.rules; mirrors the bidding upload pattern),
  reports 0-100% progress for large field videos on slow connections.
- RFIAttachment gains optional contentType so the UI can pick image thumbnail
  vs inline <video> player vs file link.
- Create RFI modal: 'Add photo / video' picker (accept=image/*,video/*, no
  capture attr so phones offer BOTH camera and gallery), per-file progress,
  removable thumbnail grid.
- Detail modal shows attachments; list rows show a paperclip + count.
- No storage.rules or firestore.rules change required.
